      "summary": "A diet-friendly Turkish pide made with rice paper instead of traditional dough, ready in about 10 minutes. Each piece is approximately 160\u2013190 kcal and is high in protein from ground meat and eggs. The creator credits simple recipes like this for losing 30 kg through smart eating rather than strict dieting.",
