      "summary": "TikTok creator Vinny Rodriguez ranks popular personal finance influencers on a tier list from S to F. He places Braden Shaw at S-tier for tax mitigation advice and networking, Caleb Hammer and Your Rich BFF at A-tier, Mark Tilbury at B-tier, himself at C-tier, Call to Leap at D-tier, and Dave Ramsey at F-tier for being too rigid about debt avoidance. The video is a useful quick-reference for evaluating which finance creators are worth following based on your financial stage.",
