      "image_text": "@TRAVEL_LUCKK\n\n6\nCOFFEES\nIN PORTUGAL\nYOU PROBABLY\nDON'T KNOW\n\nSAVE THIS BEFORE\nYOUR TRIP \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9\n\nStand at the counter.\nOrder in Portuguese.\nPay \u20ac0.80\n\n---\n\n@TRAVEL_LUCKK                                                                                    2 / 9\n\nBICA\n\nA classic\nPortuguese espresso.\n\nBest drunk\nquickly, standing\nat the counter.\n\nIn Lisbon,\nthis is the word\nlocals use.\n\n---\n\n@TRAVEL_LUCKK                                                                                    3 / 9\n\nCIMBALINO\n\nThe same espresso \u2014\nbut in Porto.\n\nOrder this name\nif you want to\nsound local there.\n\nSay \"cimbalino\"\nin Lisbon and\npeople may smile.\n\n---\n\n@TRAVEL_LUCKK                                                                                    4 / 9\n\nGAL\u00c3O\n\nA milky coffee,\nsimilar to a latte.\n\nUsually served\nin a tall glass,\ngreat in the morning.\n\nThink more milk,\nless coffee \u2014\nabout 1:3.\n\n---\n\n@TRAVEL_LUCKK                                                                                    5 / 9\n\nMEIA\nDE LEITE\n\nHalf coffee,\nhalf milk.\n\nA popular\nbreakfast coffee.\n\nSofter than\nespresso, but\nstill very local.\n\n---\n\n@TRAVEL_LUCKK                                                                                    6 / 9\n\nPINGADO\n\nAn espresso\nwith a drop of milk.\n\nPerfect if\nblack coffee feels\ntoo strong.\n\nA small change,\nbut very\ncommon.\n\n---\n\n@TRAVEL_LUCKK                                                                                    7 / 9\n\nABATANADO\n\nA longer coffee\nwith more water.\n\nGood when you\nwant something\nsofter and slower.\n\nPortugal's\nanswer to\na long coffee.\n\n---\n\n@TRAVEL_LUCKK                                                                                    8 / 9\n\nHOW TO\nORDER\n\n\"Um caf\u00e9,\npor favor\"\nespresso\n\n\"Sem a\u00e7\u00facar\"\nno sugar\n\n\"Com leite\"\nwith milk\n\n---\n\nSTAND\nAT THE\nCOUNTER\n\nBetter coffee.\n\nLower price.\n\nMore local.\n\n\u20ac 0.80\u20131.20 AT THE\nCOUNTER\n\nSend me your travel dates \u2014\nI'll build your route through\nthe best coffee spots in Portugal\n\n@TRAVEL_LUCKK \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9",
