      "author": "Portugal Travel Advisor | Julia T",
      "platform": "instagram",
      "body_text": "Most travelers arrive in Portugal and order \u201ccoffee\u201d like they\u2019re back home.\n\nAnd then they get confused.\n\nBecause here, coffee has its own little language:\nBICA in Lisbon.\nCIMBALINO in Porto.\nGAL\u00c3O in a tall glass.\nMEIA DE LEITE for breakfast.\nPINGADO when espresso feels too strong.\nABATANADO when you want something longer and softer.\n\nThe best part?\n\nYou don\u2019t need to become a coffee expert.\nYou just need to know what to ask for \u2014 and where to stand.\n\nIn Portugal, coffee at the counter is usually cheaper, faster, and much more local.\n\nSave this before your trip to Portugal \ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf9\n\nAnd if you want your Portugal route planned with the right caf\u00e9s, neighborhoods, timings, restaurants, and no tourist traps \u2014 send me your travel dates.\n\nI\u2019ll help you build a trip that actually feels like Portugal.\n\n#portugaltravel #lisbontravel #portugalcoffee #travelportugal #travelluck",
      "captions": null,
