      "image_text": "[Slide 1: Grid of four video frames showing a woman eating and preparing Turkish pide-style pastries with ground meat, tomatoes, and herbs on a wooden board, with red roses and marble countertop in background. No substantive text overlay.]\n\n[Slide 2: Grid of four video frames showing preparation steps including squeezing lemon over a pide, a pink/red mixture in a food processor, mixing ingredients in a wooden bowl, and pouring yellow liquid into a pan. No substantive text overlay.]\n\n[Slide 3: Grid of four video frames showing wrapping meat mixture in yellow rice paper, folding and sealing the parcels, and arranging finished pides on parchment paper with tomato slices and herbs visible. No substantive text overlay.]\n\n[Slide 4: Grid of three video frames showing the finished rice paper pides being removed from oven on parchment paper, the woman holding a lemon slice above a plated pide, and a close-up of the woman smiling while holding a finished pide. No substantive text overlay.]",
