      "summary": "A quick, diet-friendly Turkish pide made with rice paper instead of traditional dough, filled with a spiced ground beef mixture. Each piece is approximately 160\u2013190 kcal, gluten-free, and high in protein. The creator credits this style of smart, lighter cooking with losing 30 kg.",
      "key_takeaways": [
