      "image_text": "[Slide 1: Grid of 4 video frames showing a woman eating and preparing Turkish pide-style pastries with ground meat, tomatoes, and herbs on a wooden board, with a vase of red roses in the background]\n\n[Slide 2: Grid of 4 video frames showing preparation steps including squeezing lemon over the dish, a food processor with pink/red mixture, whisking egg mixture in a pan, and lifting a thin crepe-like wrapper]\n\n[Slide 3: Grid of 4 video frames showing assembly of rice paper pide: wrapping meat filling in yellow rice paper wrappers, placing on parchment paper, and the finished baked pide with tomato slices and herbs on top]\n\n[Slide 4: Grid of 3 video frames showing the finished dish being removed from the oven on parchment paper, the woman holding a lemon slice above a completed pide, and her holding and presenting a finished pide]",
