      "summary": "A quick and satisfying chopped wrap featuring air-fried hot honey chicken tenders piled onto a BLT-style base of bacon, iceberg lettuce, tomato, and American cheese. Everything gets chopped together on a cutting board, drizzled with more hot honey, and stuffed into a toasted XL tortilla. Simple to assemble and packed with sweet heat flavor.",
