      "summary": "A hearty chopped chicken BLT wrap featuring grilled chicken thighs, oven-baked bacon, lettuce, tomato, and cheese all chopped together and dressed with mayo, olive oil, and red wine vinegar. The mixture is loaded into a large tortilla, then pan-toasted until crispy. A flavorful, high-protein meal that's easy enough for any weeknight.",
